Package: geomarker
Title: Geomarker Assessment using S2 Cells and Dates
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Cole", "Brokamp", , "cole@colebrokamp.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0289-3151"))
Description: The s2_cell_dates vector class stores an s2::s2_cell vector with a list of date vectors, one for each s2 cell. Geomarker assessment functions use this format to complete spatiotemporal linkage of extant environmental and sociodemographic data.
